{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5d0226c7-4ff1-87a4-9574-f81ba0538562",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T11:27:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:24:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, I got a parking ticket here and it's, hold on, let me put this down. Okay. It's wrong. The meter was broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can help with that. Do you have the ticket number in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got it somewhere, it's, [pause] here. It's... I'll read it, you ready? It's, uh, 40-7-7-1-9-2."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me pull that up. And may I have your name, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Frank Pellegrino. I'm at 297 Annandale Road, North End. But I got the ticket downtown, not at the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, Mr. Pellegrino. I have the citation here. What is your concern with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I put coins in that thing, like four quarters, and nothing. The screen never changed, it just ate them. Never registered. Then I come back, there's a ticket on the windshield. Wicked annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. You can contest the citation. Since you're disputing it, it would go to a hearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so when's the hearing? What's the date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:25:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One moment. [pause] I don't see a hearing date scheduled yet. Once the contest request is on file, a notice with the date is mailed to you at the address on the registration."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:26:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, fine. Mail it. Sorry, somebody left a bag of oranges on my porch this morning, I'm trying to get it inside while I'm on the phone. No note or anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:26:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's, well, that's a nice surprise, I suppose. Is there anything else on the citation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. If I have to pay it, though, and I'm not saying I will, can I pay on a Saturday or Sunday? I'm not getting down there during the week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall is closed on weekends, so you couldn't pay in person. There is a drop box outside for payments, and you may be able to pay online at any hour. The city website has the details."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:26:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online, okay. And the box, that's by the front door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sir, at the main entrance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:26:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks. I'll get the contest thing in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:27:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pellegrino. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
